3. Remote Origin Setup & Secure Push Protocol
Connecting the local repository to the secure remote origin hosted on GitHub, utilizing token-based authentication and SSH key verification.
# Add secure remote origin
git remote add origin git@github.com:c-matthew-blackwell/sasa-v9.1-core.git

# Stage deployment documents and material stress matrices
git add docs/SASA_v9.1_Deployment_Document.md materials/aggregate_matrices/
git commit -m "chore: initialize SASA-v9.1 deployment documentation and physical aggregate stress matrices"

# Push main branch with signed tags
git push -u origin main
git tag -a v9.1.0 -m "SASA-v9.1 Stable Release - Independent Designer C. Matthew Blackwell"
git push origin v9.1.0

